#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"Comprehensive cookie consent management with automated scanner, smart "
"registry, and GDPR compliance. Scan, categorize, and manage cookies with an "
"intuitive interface."
msgstr ""
"Gestión integral del consentimiento de cookies con escáner automatizado, "
"registro inteligente y cumplimiento del RGPD. Escanee, clasifique y gestione "
"las cookies con una interfaz intuitiva."

